The tie function is defined as follows:
```javascript
function tie_compare(ty, index, Ties) {
    for (var i = 0; i < Ties.length && Index[i] !== 0; i++) {
        if (ty !== Ties[i]) {
            return -1;
        }
    }
    return 0;
}
```
